WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.489 --> 00:00:20.996
The Boneyard Brass Band was playing "The Creature Conga," but Ben didn't feel like joining in.

2
00:00:22.116 --> 00:00:25.478
He floated to a corner and watched the line of monsters go by.

3
00:00:27.318 --> 00:00:31.240
He was miserable, while everyone else seemed to be having a great time.

4
00:00:33.324 --> 00:00:36.565
Gaby and Waldo danced past and waved happily at Ben.

5
00:00:41.666 --> 00:00:44.907
The next time they passed Ben, Waldo broke out of the line.

6
00:00:49.708 --> 00:00:50.949
Winnie?" he asked.

7
00:00:51.889 --> 00:00:52.769
Ben sighed.

8
00:00:52.789 --> 00:00:55.290
"She's mad at me.

9
00:00:56.430 --> 00:00:59.531
I tried to explain everything to her, but she thought I was lying."

10
00:00:59.551 --> 00:01:02.452
"Oh, man," said Waldo.

11
00:01:03.432 --> 00:01:05.513
"It's my fault for asking you to come to the lab.

12
00:01:06.473 --> 00:01:08.354
Do you want me to cast a love spell on Winnie?

13
00:01:09.515 --> 00:01:10.915
I could run home and get my spell book."

14
00:01:12.136 --> 00:01:13.096
Ben shook his head.

15
00:01:13.116 --> 00:01:14.437
"No, thanks."

16
00:01:15.978 --> 00:01:19.379
He remembered what had happened the last time Waldo cast a love spell.

17
00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:23.581
Plus it seemed wrong to do that to Winnie.

18
00:01:23.601 --> 00:01:26.302
"Okay," said Waldo.

19
00:01:26.322 --> 00:01:28.343
"Let me know if you change your mind.

20
00:01:29.183 --> 00:01:29.984
I'm really sorry."

21
00:01:31.276 --> 00:01:35.219
The wizard headed back to the dance floor while Ben grabbed a slug cupcake.

22
00:01:37.981 --> 00:01:39.983
Then he found a different corner to sit in.

23
00:01:46.088 --> 00:01:52.693
As the skeleton band started playing a new song, Ben noticed something strange—purple fog spreading through the gym.

24
00:01:55.596 --> 00:01:58.158
A few monsters had stopped dancing to stare at it.

25
00:01:58.178 --> 00:02:02.028
"Cool!" said Mog.

26
00:02:02.048 --> 00:02:04.469
"That fog is pretty!"

27
00:02:04.989 --> 00:02:06.270
said a girl skeleton.

28
00:02:06.290 --> 00:02:10.771
"Just like you," replied the ghoul she was dancing with.

29
00:02:11.331 --> 00:02:15.332
"That's odd," Ben thought as more fog seeped into the gymnasium.

30
00:02:15.352 --> 00:02:20.014
"It looks like the purple fog from the science lab."

31
00:02:21.855 --> 00:02:25.596
Soon monsters started to cough, and the band stopped playing.

32
00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:30.441
"Everything is totally under control!"

33
00:02:30.761 --> 00:02:31.382
shouted Mr.

34
00:02:31.442 --> 00:02:35.804
Freaky. The principal ran around the gymnasium, opening windows.

35
00:02:35.824 --> 00:02:41.867
"I'm not sure what this fog is—probably just part of the decorations.

36
00:02:42.488 --> 00:02:44.009
We'll get it cleared out in a moment!

37
00:02:44.989 --> 00:02:47.170
Oh, I hope Miss Bungle gets better soon.

38
00:02:47.530 --> 00:02:49.451
I can barely run this school without her!"

39
00:02:51.673 --> 00:02:53.674
After a few minutes, the fog cleared.

40
00:02:54.574 --> 00:02:57.496
Bones rattled as the skeleton band started playing again.

41
00:03:00.040 --> 00:03:03.423
Across the room Ben saw Winnie start dancing with Zork again.

42
00:03:03.443 --> 00:03:08.007
"I'm out of here," he decided, heading for the exit.

43
00:03:08.027 --> 00:03:11.549
"What a miserable night," he thought.

44
00:03:12.510 --> 00:03:16.653
He could forget about ever dancing with Winnie—she was barely speaking to him now.

45
00:03:26.521 --> 00:03:29.464
During homeroom on Monday, Winnie didn't look at Ben.

46
00:03:30.720 --> 00:03:34.342
He thought about trying to explain things again, but suddenly Mr.

47
00:03:34.402 --> 00:03:36.863
Freaky's voice blared over the loudspeaker.

48
00:03:36.883 --> 00:03:40.844
"Attention, students.

49
00:03:41.224 --> 00:03:43.105
We will have a short assembly this morning."

50
00:03:43.125 --> 00:03:47.287
"Uh-oh," a few kids murmured.

51
00:03:48.347 --> 00:03:50.348
Ben wondered what the assembly was about.

52
00:03:51.609 --> 00:03:54.290
Maybe something about the dance the purple fog?

53
00:03:55.190 --> 00:03:58.732
It could even be about what happened in the science lab with Waldo's experiment.

54
00:04:02.502 --> 00:04:05.344
Students filed into the auditorium, and Mr.

55
00:04:05.404 --> 00:04:07.125
Freaky stepped up to the microphone.

56
00:04:11.048 --> 00:04:12.009
morning, everyone.

57
00:04:12.329 --> 00:04:14.811
The Monster Mash dance was a terrific success."

58
00:04:16.392 --> 00:04:18.834
Around Ben, students clapped and cheered.

59
00:04:23.298 --> 00:04:25.119
"As you know," Mr.

60
00:04:25.159 --> 00:04:28.801
Freaky continued, "the mayor's wife, Mrs.

61
00:04:28.841 --> 00:04:30.601
Hubbletree, was at the dance.

62
00:04:31.322 --> 00:04:32.622
She had a wonderful time!

63
00:04:33.923 --> 00:04:38.385
In fact, she thinks the students of People Place should take a field trip to visit us.

64
00:04:39.565 --> 00:04:42.506
That way, more humans can get to know monsters.

65
00:04:43.267 --> 00:04:45.228
Maybe they won't be so scared of us anymore."

66
00:04:48.209 --> 00:04:49.549
A goblin looked worried.

67
00:04:49.569 --> 00:04:55.092
"You mean, a whole bunch of humans will come to Monster Academy at once?"

68
00:04:57.680 --> 00:04:59.521
"Yes," replied Mr.

69
00:04:59.561 --> 00:05:02.161
Freaky. A troll shivered.

70
00:05:02.181 --> 00:05:08.563
"Scary!" "Dave is a human," Jen reminded everyone.

71
00:05:08.583 --> 00:05:11.164
"He's not scary at all."

72
00:05:14.885 --> 00:05:16.325
students." Mr.

73
00:05:16.365 --> 00:05:17.605
Freaky held up his hands.

74
00:05:17.625 --> 00:05:19.766
"This will be fun!

75
00:05:20.666 --> 00:05:26.688
And if everything goes well, Mayor Hubbletree will consider taking down the fence that separates Monsterville and People

76
00:05:26.728 --> 00:05:30.569
Place. Wouldn't that be wonderful?"

77
00:05:31.989 --> 00:05:36.271
The students clapped politely, but Ben could tell that a few were nervous.

78
00:05:36.291 --> 00:05:41.153
"We do need to prepare for our guests," Mr.

79
00:05:41.193 --> 00:05:41.893
Freaky added.

80
00:05:42.713 --> 00:05:47.495
The principal spent the next few minutes explaining that the school had to be cleaned from top to

81
00:05:47.535 --> 00:05:52.057
bottom. "No more slime trails or drool puddles," said Mr.

82
00:05:52.097 --> 00:05:56.619
Freaky. "And I've heard that humans like something called pizza.

83
00:05:57.539 --> 00:05:59.160
We'll see if we can order some of that.

84
00:06:00.928 --> 00:06:02.449
"Finally," Mr.

85
00:06:02.509 --> 00:06:06.970
Freaky said, "we'll all need to act a bit more humanlike."

86
00:06:08.070 --> 00:06:09.251
Mog raised his hand.

87
00:06:09.271 --> 00:06:11.051
"What does that mean?"

88
00:06:11.071 --> 00:06:16.213
"It means we should not do some of the things that we normally do," said Mr.

89
00:06:16.273 --> 00:06:19.914
Freaky. "The zombies should try not to drool too much.

90
00:06:21.114 --> 00:06:25.235
Witches and wizards—limit your mind reading and scary magic spells.

91
00:06:26.436 --> 00:06:31.934
And to all you ghosts, please remember to avoid floating through walls in front of the humans.

92
00:06:32.815 --> 00:06:34.095
It tends to scare them."

93
00:06:35.036 --> 00:06:36.576
Ben felt hot all over.

94
00:06:36.596 --> 00:06:41.559
"I couldn't do that even if I wanted to," he thought, shooting a glance at Winnie.
